### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Registrar un usuario
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombreCompleto": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2. Login (copiar el token de la respuesta)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ========== CATEGORIES ==========

### 3. Crear categoría - Rock (requiere JWT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Rock",
  "description": "Vinilos de música rock clásica y moderna"
}

### 4. Crear categoría - Jazz (requiere JWT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Jazz",
  "description": "Vinilos de jazz y blues"
}

### 5. Crear categoría - Electronic (requiere JWT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Electronic",
  "description": "Música electrónica y dance"
}

### 6. Obtener todas las categorías (requiere JWT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Obtener categoría por ID (requiere JWT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Actualizar categoría (requiere JWT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/categories/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "description": "Vinilos de rock clásico, alternativo y progresivo"
}

### 9. Eliminar categoría (requiere JWT)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/categories/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========== TAGS ==========

### 10. Crear tag - Vintage (requiere JWT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tags
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Vintage"
}

### 11. Crear tag - Rare (requiere JWT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tags
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Rare"
}

### 12. Crear tag - Limited Edition (requiere JWT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tags
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Limited Edition"
}

### 13. Crear tag - Remastered (requiere JWT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tags
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Remastered"
}

### 14. Obtener todos los tags (requiere JWT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 15. Obtener tag por ID (requiere JWT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tags/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 16. Actualizar tag (requiere JWT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tags/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Vintage Collection"
}

### 17. Eliminar tag (requiere JWT)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tags/4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========== PRODUCTS - GESTIÓN (Protegido) ==========

### 18. Crear producto - Vinilo (requiere JWT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "The Wall",
  "description": "Álbum conceptual doble de Pink Floyd",
  "price": 65.99,
  "stock": 3,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "artist": "Pink Floyd",
  "label": "Harvest Records",
  "releaseYear": 1979,
  "format": "LP",
  "condition": "Mint",
  "sku": "PF-WALL-1979",
  "tagIds": [1, 3]
}

### 19. Obtener producto por ID (requiere JWT - gestión)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/id/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 20. Actualizar producto por ID (requiere JWT y ownership)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/id/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "price": 49.99,
  "stock": 4,
  "tagIds": [1, 2, 4]
}

### 21. Actualizar producto por slug (requiere JWT y ownership)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/dark-side-of-the-moon-a1b2c3d4
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "price": 47.99,
  "condition": "Very Good"
}

### 22. Eliminar producto por ID (requiere JWT y ownership)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/id/6
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 23. Eliminar producto por slug (requiere JWT y ownership)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/the-wall-e5f6g7h8
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========== PRODUCTS - PÚBLICO ==========

### 24. Obtener todos los productos (público)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### 25. Obtener productos con paginación
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?page=1&limit=5

### 26. Filtrar por categoría (por ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?categoryId=1

### 27. Filtrar por categoría (por nombre)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?category=Rock

### 28. Filtrar por rango de precio
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?price_min=20&price_max=50

### 29. Filtrar por múltiples tags
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?tags=1,2

### 30. Filtrar por artista (búsqueda parcial)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?artist=Pink Floyd

### 31. Filtrar por sello discográfico
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?label=Harvest

### 32. Filtrar por año de lanzamiento
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?releaseYear=1973

### 33. Filtrar por formato
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?format=LP

### 34. Filtrar por condición
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?condition=Mint

### 35. Búsqueda de texto (nombre, descripción, artista, sello)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?search=Floyd

### 36. Filtros combinados
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?categoryId=1&format=LP&price_min=30&price_max=60&sortBy=price&order=ASC

### 37. Obtener producto por slug (público)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/dark-side-of-the-moon-a1b2c3d4

### ========== SELF-HEALING URL ==========

### 38. Self-Healing URL - Slug correcto (devuelve 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/p/1-dark-side-of-the-moon-a1b2c3d4

### 39. Self-Healing URL - Slug incorrecto (redirige 301)
GET {{baseUrl}}/p/1-wrong-slug

### 40. Self-Healing URL - Slug desactualizado (redirige 301)
GET {{baseUrl}}/p/1-old-product-name

### ========== TEST SIN AUTENTICACIÓN (deben fallar) ==========

### 24. Intentar crear categoría sin token (debe fallar con 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Category"
}

### 25. Intentar obtener categorías sin token (debe fallar con 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories

### 26. Intentar crear tag sin token (debe fallar con 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tags
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Tag"
}

### 27. Intentar obtener tags sin token (debe fallar con 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tags
